        <mxCell id="lMvSMg3vNdxG5hSPP2Z_-316" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" value="Triggered manually&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Choose branch frome a list of integrations branches (&lt;b&gt;integration/X.X.X&lt;/b&gt;)&lt;br&gt;to release&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="210" width="210" x="70" y="2060" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lMvSMg3vNdxG5hSPP2Z_-317" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=center;" value="Branch &lt;b&gt;release/X.X.X&amp;nbsp; &lt;/b&gt;ready to deliver" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="210" width="380" x="830" y="2060" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lMvSMg3vNdxG5hSPP2Z_-318" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;align=center;" value="1.Get all services images (now contains &#39;-rc&#39; or &#39;-rc-X&#39;), retag them as X.X.X and push to artifactory.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2.The pipeline create a new branch &lt;b&gt;release/&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;X.X.X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;from the selected branch, on&amp;nbsp;&lt;b style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Chart-Repo, Backand, frontendLego&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;b style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;client_config&lt;br style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;&lt;/b&gt;(for hotfixes)&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;3.Create a tag&amp;nbsp;&lt;b style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;release/&lt;/b&gt;X.X.X&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;in all the repositories where the integration tag &lt;b&gt;integration/X.X.X&lt;/b&gt; is located.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="210" width="380" x="370" y="2060" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
